# Base klipper patches NOT applied on the AD5X.
#
# The AD5X shipped (Sep 2025) a near-mainline Klipper, roughly four years newer
# than the AD5M stock these base patches were written against. Each patch below
# is a small upstream fix that AD5X's own stock either already carries in a
# newer form or predates by only a short window; overlaying Forge-X's older
# whole-file version would REGRESS AD5X (drop TriggerDispatch/error_mcu in mcu,
# ProbeSessionHelper in probe, is_shutdown in heaters, and would re-enable a TMC
# error check FlashForge deliberately disabled). So AD5X keeps its own stock for
# these modules. The two genuine correctness fixes here (mcu 8e6e467 trsync
# timing, tmc 8dd798e set_dir_inverted) reach AD5X via a later stock update.
#
# One relative path per line, relative to .py/klipper/patches/.
mcu.py
extras/gcode_button.py
extras/heaters.py
extras/probe.py
extras/servo.py
extras/tmc.py
